OL,3,AIs India's internet boom running into
OL,4,Aan undersea problem?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of India's biggest digital
OL,7,Fvulnerabilities sits on a six-kilometre
OL,8,Fstretch of Mumbai's Arabian Sea coast.
OL,10,FAround Versova, a densely populated
OL,11,Fneighbourhood on the city's northwest,
OL,12,Fat least 13 of India's 18
OL,13,Fintercontinental submarine cables come
OL,14,Fashore within six kilometres of one
OL,15,Fanother.
OL,17,FTogether they carry as much as 95% of
OL,18,FIndia's international bandwidth to
OL,19,FEurope, Africa and West Asia.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
