OL,3,AIs India's internet boom running into
OL,4,Aan undersea problem?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This network faces a critical
OL,7,Fvulnerability due to severe geographic
OL,8,Fconcentration," says Anwesha Sen of
OL,9,FTakshashila Institution, a think tank.
